# 12-vcs.md §2; every value is synthetic.
# The derived identities of [F08 §11]: BLAKE3-128 over lp()-framed arguments.

%% case file-no-pred
%% source [F08 §11.2]
%% source [F08 §11.1]
%% note [F08 §11.2]'s informative example: the 46 hashed bytes, and the uid they give.
%% function uid_file
%% arg root "project"
%% arg path "docs/a.md"
%% arg pred -
%% input-hex
; lp("moirai-file-v1")
0e0000006d6f697261692d66696c652d7631
; lp(r)
0700000070726f6a656374
; lp(p)
09000000646f63732f612e6d64
; lp(q = empty)
00000000
%% input-length 46
%% output d8253f84275a6c5b2fe5dbdb2bc28532
%% end

